      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 15  
      **Languages** understands Elvish and Sylvan but can't speak them  
      **Challenge** 1/4 (50 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Actions

      ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d4+3,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage.

      ## Bonus Actions

      ***Teleport (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 4-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Teleport])).*** The dog teleports up to 40 feet to an unoccupied space it can see.

